<title>UK: Bau-und Boden adds 100 mln DEM to REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Bau-und Boden adds 100 mln DEM to REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 200 million marks from 100 million marks lead manager</p>
<p>Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU-UND BODEN</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN DEM   COUPON     *6.0	MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  20 BP  NOTES     **LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 100 MLN MARKS ON 10.JUL.97</p>
<p>		*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN PAYS 80 PCT OF THE REX-LINKED</p>
<p>		 SUBINDEX.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
